李世民","count":5,"offset":2334,"excerpt":"利是視。武周，事胡者也。太原一方都會，且義兵家屬在焉，不如還救根本，更圖後舉。」李世民曰：「今禾菽被野，何優乏糧！老生輕躁，一戰可擒。李密顧戀倉粟，未遑遠略。武周與突厥外雖相附，內實相猜。武周雖遠利太原，豈可近忘馬邑！本興大義，奮不顧身以救蒼生，","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:suishu-4c4d0abd3819bbff","bookId":"book:suishu","requestedTitle":"隋書/卷05","title":"隋書/卷05","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B705","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2597228","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B705?action=history","revisionId":2597228,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-09-10T11:39:35Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:49:02.326Z","sha256":"ceae424fb963f3ef582c3ef205d0bf013141cc55a180787dd70f9fe709d4b186","textSha256":"96f27f14e71e43fc6f266518e0789932df589871599a153e2a5d709e1cc74874","expandedWikitextSha256":"ceae424fb963f3ef582c3ef205d0bf013141cc55a180787dd70f9fe709d4b186","characters":1767,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/suishu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.674Z","upstreamTextQuality":25,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 25% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/69ea833c2033760318ab.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/69ea833c2033760318ab.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]}